<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:01:10.058" end="00:01:13.058" style="s2">Ha! Who dares to enter my forest?</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.000" end="00:01:35.500" style="s2">Wolves.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.500" end="00:01:45.500" style="s2">Die, monster!</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.000" end="00:02:49.500" style="s2">Aren! Where have you been all this time?</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.500" end="00:02:54.500" style="s2">I was defending the village<br />from the forest monsters.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.000" end="00:02:59.600" style="s2">Right now, you&#39;d serve the village better<br />by taking these potato peels to Gorm.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.700" end="00:03:03.500" style="s2">He&#39;s been waiting a very long time,<br />thanks to your heroic defense.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.000" end="00:03:08.000" style="s2">The world will never understand its heroes.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.800" end="00:03:12.500" style="s2">Potato peels... more important<br />than the fate of the world.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.800" end="00:03:18.000" style="s2">Aren.<br />Haven&#39;t you forgotten something?</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.000" end="00:03:21.000" style="s2">Fine, fine.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.000" end="00:03:26.500" style="s2">My hero.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.800" end="00:03:29.000" style="s2">Now run along to Gorm and don&#39;t dawdle.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.100" end="00:03:31.200" style="s2">I want us to eat supper<br />while it&#39;s still warm.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.300" end="00:03:33.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back when I&#39;m back!</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.000" end="00:04:05.000" style="s2">Good day, Mr. Borek!</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.000" end="00:04:09.000" style="s2">Aye, good, good.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.100" end="00:04:12.200" style="s2">Would be better if folks paid on time<br />for the work done.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.500" end="00:05:07.000" style="s2">Ah, Aren!<br />Where on earth have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.500" end="00:05:17.200" style="s2">I had some business with the monsters<br />in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.000" end="00:05:22.200" style="s2">Well, the whole village must be proud<br />to have such a brave defender.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.000" end="00:05:25.500" style="s2">Where should I put the potato peels<br />from Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.000" end="00:05:30.200" style="s2">Tip them into the trough, lad.<br />The beasts are starving already.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.000" end="00:05:43.900" style="s2">Mr. Gorm, next time I&#39;ll come earlier,<br />I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.000" end="00:05:45.500" style="s2">Wait, lad.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.000" end="00:05:48.900" style="s2">There&#39;s one more thing,<br />something very important.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.000" end="00:05:52.100" style="s2">Perhaps almost as important as fighting<br />monsters in the forest, maybe even more.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.200" end="00:05:53.400" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.500" end="00:05:56.000" style="s2">Do it well,<br />and the prize will be this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.200" end="00:05:58.500" style="s2">A mighty artifact of great power.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.000" end="00:06:01.200" style="s2">Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.500" end="00:06:04.000" style="s2">Splendid!</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.000" end="00:06:11.700" style="s2">Lately, there&#39;s hardly any water in the village<br />well, and my beasts drink an awful lot of it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.800" end="00:06:15.100" style="s2">I want you to fetch me some water in that<br />bucket from the river below the village.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.200" end="00:06:18.800" style="s2">That way, we leave more water in the well<br />for those who need it more than we do.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.500" end="00:06:23.500" style="s2">Knights always help those in need.<br />I&#39;m on it!</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.000" end="00:06:46.900" style="s2">Where are you racing off to, lad?</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.000" end="00:06:49.200" style="s2">To the river! Important mission!</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.500" end="00:07:32.000" style="s2">Rook? What have you got there?</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.000" end="00:07:43.500" style="s2">What is it? Easy, boy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.000" end="00:07:48.500" style="s2">Go on, Rook. Find it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.500" end="00:07:59.000" style="s2">Good boy. Good boy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.000" end="00:08:05.500" style="s2">Who did this to you, poor thing?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.000" end="00:08:13.500" style="s2">What the...</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.000" end="00:08:41.800" style="s2">What are you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.000" end="00:08:44.500" style="s2">What in God&#39;s name are you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.500" end="00:09:32.500" style="s2">Finn again.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.000" end="00:09:44.100" style="s2">Leave it, Borek.<br />Last time it was a badger.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.200" end="00:09:46.000" style="s2">And the time before, it was fog.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.100" end="00:09:50.500" style="s2">That odd fellow probably saw things again,<br />but a horn is a horn. That&#39;s the custom.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.000" end="00:09:53.000" style="s2">Same thing every time.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.000" end="00:10:16.400" style="s2">Go inside and bar the door.<br />I&#39;ll go see what&#39;s happening.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.500" end="00:10:18.000" style="s2">Just be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.000" end="00:10:27.500" style="s2">Jara! Do you hear the bell?</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.000" end="00:10:30.500" style="s2">I hear it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.000" end="00:10:32.800" style="s2">Then get inside.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.800" end="00:10:37.100" style="s2">Aren isn&#39;t back yet.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.200" end="00:10:39.900" style="s2">Aren is safe with Gorm.<br />He&#39;s a responsible man.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.000" end="00:10:42.500" style="s2">Go inside and bar the door, please.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.000" end="00:10:51.500" style="s2">Hear that? That sound means<br />playtime&#39;s over. Come on, inside.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.000" end="00:11:02.500" style="s2">Have you no shame?<br />Waking decent folk up!</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.000" end="00:11:23.500" style="s2">Come back, you little rascal.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.500" end="00:11:37.200" style="s2">Mom would say the mill.<br />They won&#39;t see me up high.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.500" end="00:11:53.800" style="s2">Ivo, with you here,<br />even a bear won&#39;t scare us.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.000" end="00:12:00.800" style="s2">If Finn got spooked by a badger again,<br />I&#39;ll kick his backside all the way down the hill.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.000" end="00:12:03.200" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s make the rounds.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.000" end="00:12:21.700" style="s2">Remember two years ago, when Finn<br />got scared of old Marta?</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.800" end="00:12:25.100" style="s2">The one who&#39;d started forgetting herself<br />and went wandering at night?</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.200" end="00:12:28.500" style="s2">He was so scared it took him<br />a whole week to come round.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.000" end="00:12:34.200" style="s2">Stop. Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.000" end="00:12:36.500" style="s2">Do you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.000" end="00:12:51.000" style="s2">It&#39;s just a goat.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.000" end="00:12:58.800" style="s2">Hey, little one.<br />Did you get lost?</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.900" end="00:13:01.500" style="s2">Where&#39;s your owner, eh?</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.200" end="00:13:06.800" style="s2">Wonder who was scatterbrained enough<br />to lose a goat.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.000" end="00:13:09.500" style="s2">If you ask me,<br />there&#39;s a finder&#39;s fee owed.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.000" end="00:13:12.000" style="s2">Come on, don&#39;t be so greedy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.500" end="00:13:15.500" style="s2">Ivo, knock on the nearest door,<br />we&#39;ll ask.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.000" end="00:13:34.800" style="s2">What? Didn&#39;t you hear the bell?</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.000" end="00:13:40.000" style="s2">We were, uh, passing by and we found<br />a lost goat. Is it yours?</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.500" end="00:13:42.000" style="s2">Good day.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.000" end="00:13:45.000" style="s2">That&#39;s crazy Marta.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.000" end="00:13:51.000" style="s2">What are you lot scheming?<br />I don&#39;t have any goat.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.000" end="00:13:56.500" style="s2">Well, couldn&#39;t have picked a better door.<br />Maybe we should just...</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.000" end="00:14:12.500" style="s2">Oh, you cursed devils!</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.800" end="00:14:16.200" style="s2">What in Ardos&#39;s name hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.000" end="00:14:22.200" style="s2">What in blazes is that thing?</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.000" end="00:14:26.800" style="s2">Are you all right?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.000" end="00:14:33.800" style="s2">Get back! Get back!</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.000" end="00:14:35.800" style="s2">Back, you devil!</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.000" end="00:14:39.200" style="s2">Whatever you are,<br />you won&#39;t live long!</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.500" end="00:14:47.200" style="s2">Come on then!</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.000" end="00:15:14.000" style="s2">Ivo! Keep it back a moment!<br />It&#39;s afraid of fire!</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.000" end="00:15:18.800" style="s2">Over here, you ugly brute!<br />Come on, look at me!</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.200" end="00:15:37.200" style="s2">Oh, you blockhead!<br />What have you done?</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.300" end="00:15:40.200" style="s2">What have you done, you blockhead?!</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.000" end="00:15:55.600" style="s2">I didn&#39;t mean it, I swear! I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.700" end="00:15:57.800" style="s2">It&#39;ll heal before the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.000" end="00:16:01.000" style="s2">Stay away from me!<br />And from my feet!</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.500" end="00:16:12.800" style="s2">What in blazes is this cursed thing?</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.500" end="00:16:17.000" style="s2">We have to get everyone<br />out of the village. Now!</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.100" end="00:16:19.500" style="s2">Nobody knows where this thing<br />crawled out from.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.500" end="00:16:48.500" style="s2">Shh!</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.500" end="00:16:53.500" style="s2">Do you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.000" end="00:17:05.500" style="s2">Run!</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.500" end="00:17:19.000" style="s2">Aren?</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.500" end="00:18:56.800" style="s2">Rook? Where&#39;s Finn?</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.500" end="00:19:03.200" style="s2">Come here, Rook. It&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.000" end="00:19:18.500" style="s2">Looks like they&#39;re getting ready<br />for something.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.500" end="00:19:30.800" style="s2">So... what now?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.000" end="00:19:33.800" style="s2">Now we find out<br />how to get out of here.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
